  "card": "Prevents overlapping scantxoutset RPC calls from permanently bricking the RPC until node restart. Currently, a finishing scan clears the reservation flag before resetting the progress indicator, allowing a subsequent scan caller to acquire the reservation, fail a progress check, and throw an uncaught exception before registering its cleanup guard. The fix resets progress while the reservation is still held. This fixes a node-restart-requiring deadlock bug in RPC utxo scanning.",
